OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,BRepublic of Ireland to face Croatia in 
OL,5,BNations League play-off                
OL,6,GThe Republic of Ireland will face      
OL,7,GCroatia in a two-legged Nations League 
OL,8,Gpromotion/relegation play-off in March.
OL,10,FHeimir Hallgrimsson's side will host   
OL,11,Fthe first leg on Saturday, 27 March    
OL,12,Fbefore they travel to face the world   
OL,13,Fnumber 15 side in the return game      
OL,14,Fthree days later.                      
OL,16,FThe Republic of Ireland, who have      
OL,17,Fnever been promoted to League A of the 
OL,18,FNations League, finished second behind 
OL,19,Fgroup winners Austria in Group B3.     
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
